# F4 Personal Time Capsules ("Future you"). Loaded by tool/l10n_source.py.
# s(key, en, desc, te, te_Latn, ph=None) · edit(key, en=, te=, tl=, desc=)
# te / te_Latn are first drafts: NEEDS NATIVE REVIEW before alpha.
#
# Voice: warm and quiet. A capsule is a note to oneself; nothing here is a
# countdown, a score or a nudge. Lock-screen copy never names a mood, a date
# or anything the person wrote (PRD 15-permissions, 12-notifications).

# ---- entry (Sanctuary) and list ---------------------------------------------
s("capsules_title", "Future you", "Title of the time-capsules area (Sanctuary section and the capsules list). Notes the person seals for their future self.", "భవిష్యత్తులో మీరు", "Future you")
