s("capsules_accountDeletionCount", "{count, plural, =1{1 sealed capsule will be lost.} other{{count} sealed capsules will be lost.}}", "Delete-account confirmation: sealed (unopened) capsules that deletion removes (PRD F4 edge cases).", "{count, plural, =1{దాచిన 1 క్యాప్సూల్ పోతుంది.} other{దాచిన {count} క్యాప్సూల్స్ పోతాయి.}}", "{count, plural, =1{Seal chesina 1 capsule potundi.} other{Seal chesina {count} capsules potaayi.}}", INT("count"))
